{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2021-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1623801600, "end_date": 1624406399, "month_true_total": 1928, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:44:49 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "94192278", "author": {"steamid": "76561198799152647", "personaname": "hhhh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hjggjgghkjgkhj7866/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 105, "playtime_forever": 1711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 636, "last_played": 1649564116, "avatar": "96264aa0d13ed5067038ce361ba13fc2143a4cfb"}, "language": "english", "review": "rain", "timestamp_created": 1624406034, "timestamp_updated": 1624406034, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94191189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198169858530", "personaname": "Champion919", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198169858530/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 26739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 25, "playtime_at_review": 26268, "last_played": 1788736516, "avatar": "aff094a4a4bb8602633477d9fcad3e68ace1838c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun. But there's so much more I can say. Play it. Addicting progression, fun mechanics, CHALLENGE. There is so much to see, do, experiment with, and unlock with this games that there is nothing I can say that could truly quantify the absolute quality of this game. With a bunch of unlockable characters that each have vastly different playstyles, nothing I can say can truly do this absolute masterpiece of a game justice. Just play it. PLAY IT.\n\nUpdate: I've played uh...a bit more. It's still a phenomenal game, however I've begun to simply just become accustomed to mods using r2modman, and let me tell you, it is so much fun. With a nearly unlimited amount of changes that can be made with mods, there's a little something for everyone. Did you want to play as ganondorf, griddy'ing around the map while your friend plays as Goku, going Ultra Instinct and obliterating everything in a 100 foot radius? You can. With item mods, character mods, music mods (Metal Gear Rising soundtrack mod is my favorite), a mod that adds nuketown from Call of Duty as a map, skin mods, rebalance mods, and even a mod called thiccify that...I'll let you figure that one out. Risk of Rain 2 is revitalized by mods. There's even a mod that adds a pvp mode, however I have yet to try it. Risk of Rain 2 is such a great game, and I highly recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1624404018, "timestamp_updated": 1765339284, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94189672", "author": {"steamid": "76561198185781814", "personaname": "Superunknown", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198185781814/", "num_games_owned": 240, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 19014, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 104, "playtime_at_review": 18633, "last_played": 1788102288, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1624401187, "timestamp_updated": 1780078611, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": 